@crew mori
// Writer (command), batch 2: everyday lines (greet, feel, near, life, joy) from the card and the roster.

== greet
? tier=stranger
- Oh, hello. Mori, Survey. The labs are Deck 2. Please don't touch the labels.
? tier>=acquaintance
- Oh, hi, {me}. Sorry, I was counting. I'm always counting.
- Hello, {me}. The charts are up to date. That never happens. I'm very pleased.
? tier>=friend
- {hi}, {me}. I made a note to ask how you were. So: how are you?   #warm
== feel
? mood:high
- Every sample labelled, every chart right. Even Dr. Sato said "good". Once.
? mood:low
- Long day in the lab. I relabelled a shelf that didn't need it.
== near
? deck:2 act:free
- The chart room's quiet now. You can hear the old charts curling.
? deck:2 time:evening|night
- Look, there. That one's on my chart. I drew it myself.
== life
? tier>=acquaintance
- I taped a chart over my nameplate. People know where I am. They needn't know who.   #funny
== joy
? tier>=colleague
- The chart room, late. One more survey on the map. One more bit of nowhere, named.

// ---- Writer 2, batch 2: to ~30 (greet by time and warmth, near, invite, accept, decline, missed, birthday, cue, hint, about)
== greet
? tier>=acquaintance time:morning
- Oh. Morning, {me}. Four samples in, three to go. Sorry. Hello.
? tier>=acquaintance warmth:cold
- Oh, {me}. You've been busy. I made a note to ask. So. How are you?

== near
? place:chartroom
- The chart room. Every line on that wall is somewhere we've been.
? place:calm
- Lists. Tea. More lists. I'm off duty. This is what off duty looks like.   #funny

== invite
- Observatory night? I'll show you a star on my chart. Then in the sky. They match.

== accept
- Oh. Yes. Good. I'll write it down.
- Yes, please. I'll be there at eight. Eight exactly. Sorry. Eight-ish.   #funny

== decline
- Oh, I can't. Lab inventory. Two hundred samples. Another night?
? weekday:wed|thu
- It's my rest day. I'm going to try to rest. I've made a list for it.   #funny

== missed
- You weren't there. That's all right. Your name's still on my list.

== birthday
? birthday:you
- Happy birthday, {me}. I've marked it on my chart. In pencil. I'll ink it later.   #warm
? birthday:me
- My birthday. Dr. Sato remembered. Then forgot. Then remembered again. Lovely.   #funny

== cue
? cue:tradition.observatory
- Did you see the bright one last night? Low, on the left? That's on my chart.

== hint
- {me}, have you a minute later? I've something to say. I've written it down.

== about
? aff:sato:friend
- Dr. Sato finds the stars. I find Dr. Sato's notes. It's a good partnership.   #funny

// ---- Writer 2, batch 2: top-up (bye, greet by time, life at friend tier)
== bye
- Oh. Bye, {me}. I'll put it on the list. That we talked. Sorry. Habit.   #funny
- Bye. Please don't move anything on my desk. Thank you.
== greet
? tier>=acquaintance time:afternoon
- Afternoon, {me}. Charts are all up to date. I'm almost worried.   #funny
== life
? tier>=friend
- Every survey I chart, I name one tiny rock after someone aboard. Nobody knows. Now you do.   #warm
